ADDITIONAL NOTICE — FINANCIAL SOFTWARE

This software places live orders on a cryptocurrency derivatives exchange.
It is provided for education and research only and is not investment advice.
The authors are not licensed financial advisors.

The trading strategies included here are documented as UNPROFITABLE: a 90-day
study over 274 parameter combinations found zero with positive expectancy
(see docs/RETUNE_STUDY_2026-07-21.md). Do not deploy capital against them.

Trading derivatives carries a substantial risk of loss. You are solely
responsible for any use of this software and for any resulting losses.
